       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-DIFFERENTIAL-METRIC.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DIFFERENTIAL-METRIC-PROOFS.
           05  WS-METRIC-TENSOR-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GAUSSIAN-CURVATURE-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PRINCIPAL-CURVATURE-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-METRIC-LATENCY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DIFF-METRIC-SEAL-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-DIFF-METRIC-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-MET-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-MET-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-METRIC-AND-GAUSS.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-PRINCIPAL-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-MET-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-METRIC-AND-GAUSS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-METRIC-TENSOR-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GAUSSIAN-CURVATURE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-PRINCIPAL-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PRINCIPAL-CURVATURE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-METRIC-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-MET-PROOFS.
           IF WS-METRIC-TENSOR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-GAUSSIAN-CURVATURE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PRINCIPAL-CURVATURE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-METRIC-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-DIFF-METRIC-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-MET-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-MET-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-MET-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-MET-CODE.
